font-size:65px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The Solution</span></span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5wxghq91":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:56px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:56px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This is a title.</span></span></h2>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5wxghq97":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">AI-Driven Systems:</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n<li style=\"line-height:1.8em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;\">We developed an AI-based solution that leveraged&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">historical data from the company&#39;s operations.</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.8em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This system didn&rsquo;t just automate their order entry</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">process&mdash;it actively identified error patterns and</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">flagged potential mistakes, suggesting real-time</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">corrections before the issues could impact revenue</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">or productivity.</span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Proactive Error Prevention:</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n<li style=\"line-height:1.8em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;\">The AI was integrated into their order management&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">system, proactively preventing errors and optimizing</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">the entire order entry process.</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode